    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for designing The solution as a tool of assistance without automated decisions, we no_automated_decision_without_human_validation_policy ensures that human oversight is maintained. ensures is also reinforced by we eu_ai_act_expertise and awareness of prohibited AI practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The typical legal risks we monitor include open-source license compliance, cross-border data flow (though this is intra-EU only), AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation through source code escrow and open standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The typical legal risks we monitor, it appears that we is generally compliant with the client's requirements regarding regulatory compliance, sovereignty constraints, and the design of The solution as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should continue to monitor evolving legal risks, especially those related to AI Act compliance and data protection regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is 3 million euros over 4 years, with annual operating costs that must remain controlled and compatible with The client's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, the target gross margin percentage is 28 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine our projected margin on this contract, our need to calculate the total revenue from The client's global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can secure The client's global budget as revenue, the annual revenue would be approximately 750,000 euros per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With our target gross margin percentage of 28 percent, the projected annual gross profit would be around 210,000 euros per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to optimize costs and ensure compatibility with The client's budgetary capacity, our can consider strategies such as renegotiating rates with subcontractors in case of a 10 percent budget reduction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For more significant reductions, our may need to reduce scope by removing optional modules or reducing training days. our current financial position, including our annual revenue of 4.2 million euros and net profit of 380,000 euros, suggests that our have the capacity to take on this contract while maintaining a stable financial situation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, our must closely monitor our costs and ensure that our costs align with The client's budgetary constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our standard daily rates for senior personnel, such as project managers and AI engineers, and considering the infrastructure margin percentage of 12 percent, our can propose a cost-optimized solution to the client while aiming to maintain our projected margin on this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific details on the contract requirements and scope, it's challenging to provide an exact projected margin or detailed cost-optimization strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution that facilitates access to information, improves quality of answers, and reduces processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also provide explanations for recommendations or proposals and ensure explicability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy would we propose for this project, including any potential trade-offs or limitations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the company context, I would propose an artificial intelligence solution that leverages we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities.  we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to facilitate access to information and improve the quality of answers. we have experience with fine-tuning methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, and full fine-tune on domain corpus, which can result in an average accuracy gain of 12%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide explanations for recommendations or proposals and ensure explicability and transparency, we can utilize we explainability and trust capabilities, including source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. we solution will also include confidence scoring, with a low-confidence threshold of 0.65, and a low-confidence action to display uncertainty warnings and escalate to human supervisors. we RAG capabilities can be used to retrieve relevant information from internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents, guides, notes, and repositories. we have experience with vector stores such as Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS, which can help achieve a typical retrieval precision at 5 of 0.87." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we current research topics include knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning, multi-agent collaboration frameworks, and proactive regulatory change alerting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These areas of research may be relevant to this project and could potentially enhance Our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we must also consider potential trade-offs or limitations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For example, we LLMs may not achieve the same level of performance as larger proprietary models, but achieve is an accepted trade-off for compliance with EU regulations and sovereignty constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, real-time learning from user data is prohibited due to GDPR restrictions, so we will rely on offline quarterly fine-tuning on anonymized data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we proposed AI components and innovation strategy can help address the client's requirements while ensuring explicability, transparency, and compliance with regulatory constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval also wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What CSR and sustainability strategies would we propose for this project, including any potential risks or challenges we may face?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose several strategies that align with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. capabilities and The client requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy and have a low Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This would enable Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to reduce the carbon footprint associated with data center operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can implement digital sobriety practices, such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices are expected to reduce energy consumption by approximately 35% compared to Nexus Engineering S.r.l. baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. e-waste management partner, Ecologic (France), which is certified for WEEE recycling, handles the disposal of electronic waste in an environmentally responsible manner." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, as Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a carbon reporting capability based on GRI Standards (partial), Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can provide regular reports to the client on this project carbon footprint and progress towards reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. must also acknowledge potential risks or challenges." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One such challenge is the high availability requirement of 99.9% uptime SLA, which may necessitate warm standby nodes that consume energy continuously." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate the high availability requirement of 99.9% uptime SLA, which may necessitate warm standby nodes that consume energy continuously, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can implement low-power standby mode with a wake-up time of less than 90 seconds, as stated in our known CSR tensions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another potential risk is the on-premise vs green energy trade-off, where on-premise servers might be powered by the client's electricity grid, which may not be 100% renewable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In this case, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can recommend that the client subscribes to a renewable energy Guarantee of Origin certificate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting these strategies and mitigating potential risks, we can contribute to reducing the energetic consumption and environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information while promoting Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "CSR and sustainability values." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposes an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has a strong background in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT, which aligns with the City of Belval's requirements. an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying the agents' in the agents' administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will facilitate access to information, improve the quality of answers, and reduce processing times. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will also assist in the drafting of administrative contents, such as answers to users, administrative letters, and syntheses of files. an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will integrate with the existing practices of the agents' and will not constitute a rupture in the agents' modes of work. an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will allow agents to access quickly reliable and up-to-date information coming from internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will also provide assistance with the instruction of files, proposing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users will guarantee strict adherence to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
