    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, an artificial intelligence solution designed to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users aims to provide response times compatible with daily use by agents, with a target of less than 2 seconds." ;
