    <http://example.org/node/chunk46> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk47> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk48> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk49> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires implementation of an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents, with a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years. an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents must improve efficiency of administrative services, quality of service rendered to users, and facilitate access to information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, what is our company's overall strategy for delivering an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents, including any potential risks or challenges our company's may face? our company's, has a strong background in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT, which aligns with The client requirements. our company's will utilize our company's PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, or SAFe methodologies to manage an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents, considering an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents complexity and duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, our company's will ensure that our company's solution is cost-effective while meeting the client's expectations. our company's past public sector references, such as the Comune di Torino and Regione Lombardia projects, demonstrate our company's ability to deliver successful digital transformation initiatives. our company's may consider partnering with our company's known partners, such as EuroCloud Solutions S.A., LexIA GmbH, or GreenCompute S.r.l., to leverage our known partners, such as EuroCloud Solutions S.A., LexIA GmbH, or GreenCompute S.r.l. expertise in sovereign cloud hosting, legal AI, or green IT." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's will ensure that any subcontracting does not exceed 40% of the project value." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To deliver an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents, our company's will follow our company's typical delivery structure, which includes phases such as Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support. our company's will establish a governance framework with tools like RAID logs, decision logs, change request processes, and steering committees to ensure effective communication and decision-making. our company's risk management approach will involve maintaining a risk register, reviewing risks bi-weekly, and categorizing risks into technical, financial, regulatory, operational, or reputational risks. our company's have a low-to-medium risk appetite, which will guide our company's risk mitigation strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With 60% of our company's project management capacity available as of 2024, our company's can allocate sufficient resources to an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's must carefully plan the project timeline, considering our company's next available start date of March 1, 2025, and the client's requirement for a 4-year project duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Potential risks or challenges our company's may face include ensuring the integration of our company's AI solution with the client's existing systems, managing the complexity of an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents, and meeting the expected levels of efficiency, quality, and accessibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's must comply with regulatory requirements, such as GDPR, and ensure the sovereignty of the client's data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate Potential risks or challenges we may face, our company's will work closely with the client's to understand the client's specific needs and requirements, establish a robust governance framework, and monitor project progress regularly. our company's dedicated change manager will also ensure that any changes are properly assessed, approved, and implemented." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our company's strategy is to deliver a high-quality AI solution that meets the client's expectations while minimizing risks and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements. our company's believe that our company's expertise, past experiences, and robust governance practices make our company's well-suited to deliver an artificial intelligence solution for assistance to agents successfully." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution with response times below 2 seconds, high availability (99.9%), integration with existing information systems and user directories, hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU, and no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, I can address each of The client requirements as follows: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds: our performance benchmarks indicate a p95 response time of 1800ms for RAG, which is close to but not below 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this requirement is PARTIALLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve response times, our can propose optimizing our AI/ML models and leveraging our experience with quantisation methods like INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ) to reduce latency. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability (99.9%): our past projects have achieved an availability of 99.92%, which is very close to the required 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thus, High availability (99.9%): is PARTIALLY COVERED. our can propose implementing robust monitoring using tools like Prometheus and Grafana, and leveraging our experience with auto-scaling to ensure high availability. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with existing information systems and user directories: our integration capabilities include API standards like REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, as well as experience with identity providers such as Active Directory/LDAP and Keycloak. our also have experience integrating with various ERP and CRM systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this requirement is FULLY COVERED. our propose using our API gateways (e.g., Kong) and message brokers (e.g., Apache Kafka) to facilitate seamless integration. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU: our cloud providers include OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are the EU-based and offer SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this requirement is FULLY COVERED. our propose hosting the solution on one of Our cloud providers to ensure compliance with sovereignty constraints. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers: Given our experience with EU-based cloud providers like OVHcloud and Scaleway, our can design an architecture that avoids dependencies on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This requirement is FULLY COVERED. our proposed architecture will prioritize the use of European suppliers for all components, including infrastructure, software, and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed architecture would leverage our expertise in AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, API integration, data engineering, and cybersecurity to design a solution that meets the client's requirements. our would deploy our AI/ML models on a sovereign cloud infrastructure within the EU, using our preferred cloud providers (OVHcloud or Scaleway) to ensure high availability, scalability, and compliance with regulatory requirements. our integration capabilities would facilitate seamless connections with existing information systems and user directories, while our monitoring and auto-scaling tools would help maintain response times below 2 seconds and ensure high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), explicability and transparency of AI outputs, and adherence to regulatory requirements in force." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security and regulatory compliance risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR compliance as evidenced by we certification and practices. we standard data residency is EU-only, which aligns with the client's requirement for no data transfer outside EU. we also utilize anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models to protect sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explicability and transparency of AI outputs, we ai_security_controls include output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, confidence threshold escalation, model isolation, and model update security review. our ai_security_controls contribute to the trustworthiness and understandability of our AI system's decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for adherence to regulatory requirements in force, we have experience with several frameworks including RGPD/GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS v2 (ANSSI), SecNumCloud, NIS2 Directive, and eIDAS. we gdpr_posture is robust, with a Data Protection Officer appointed and reachable at dpo@nexus-engineering.it." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag the potential risk of ensuring that we existing practices fully meet the client's specific GDPR compliance requirements, especially regarding data encryption and pseudonymisation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, while we have experience with regulatory frameworks, continuous monitoring and updates are necessary to ensure ongoing compliance with evolving regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we context, we appear to be largely compliant with the client's requirements for GDPR compliance, explicability, transparency, and adherence to regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
