    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "First, regarding GDPR compliance, we standard legal basis is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and we have a DPA template version 3.2 available. we also ensure that all client data remains The client sole property." ;
